  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 16-layer planar multilayer stack on Ge (Icenogle) substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence from air: ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS, ZnSe (Querry), ZnS. Seed thicknesses from iteration_21 candidate gradi__765c82311956: [1104.02, 898.78, 1485.15, 1624.70, 1016.12, 1146.33, 872.85, 1157.60, 1064.90, 1367.32, 1043.48, 1179.42, 920.86, 1113.98, 850.27, 1201.78] nm. Freeze layers 0, 1, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15 to their seed values. Only layers 2, 3, and 9 are tunable. Apply bounds: layer 2 in [1445, 1525] nm, layer 3 in [1445, 1500] nm (clamped from seed 1624.70), layer 9 in [1327, 1407] nm. Apply ±40 nm random initialization perturbation to layers 2, 3, 9 around their seed values (with layer 3 clamped to 1500 nm if seed exceeds bound). Optimize for high transmittance in 8000-11000 nm band and low transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band at normal incidence. Use coherent TMM solver across 3000-11000 nm wavelength range. Maximum total layers: 16. Materials: zns, ZnSe (Querry), Ge (Icenogle).",
